  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3eeccab7b33c82e4f885da9ef97ed574, type: 3}
  m_Name: Elimination
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BingoGameRuleData
  ruleType: 3
  description: Boards mark called numbers automatically. Completing an active Bingo
    pattern puts that player out. When one connected eligible player remains, that
    player wins. If multiple players enter their final check from the same ball,
    every good check wins the tie and every bad check is out. Connected eligible
    players who remain when the ball pool ends win together.
